[h1]Random New World (RNW)[/h1]

Replace the Americas with a new world for your next EU5 campaign. Sail west into unknown waters, or lead one of its native countries. The Old World stays vanilla.

[table]
[tr]
[td][url=https://github.com/Sir-Starch/eu5-random-new-world/blob/main/docs/generator-guide.md][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sir-Starch/eu5-random-new-world/main/w/enm.png[/img][/url][/td]
